===Etymology 2===
Possibly a backformation based on ''viineke'', an irregular dialectal variant of {{term|viileke||band, strap|lang=fi}}, from the same root ''√viile-'' as {{term|viiltää||to slit|lang=fi}}, from older ''*vije-''. Though appearing in writing since the 16th century, the word is unattested in colloquial speech and may be an old literary coinage.

